---
/** The task list. Blocks drop onto sessions in order, top of the list first. */
---
<p class="sec-h">Your blocks</p>
<p class="sec-sub">What you want to get through. Top of the list runs first.</p>
<div class="card">
  <div class="add-row">
    <label class="sr-only" for="blockInput">Add a block</label>
    <input
      class="text"
      id="blockInput"
      placeholder="What's a session for?"
      enterkeyhint="done"
      maxlength="80"
      autocomplete="off"
    />
    <button class="add-btn" id="addBtn" type="button">Add</button>
  </div>
  <ul class="blocks" id="blockList"></ul>
  <p class="empty-blocks" id="emptyBlocks">
    No blocks yet. Add tasks and they'll drop onto the sessions below.
  </p>
  <div class="blocks-foot">
    <span class="held" id="heldNote" aria-live="polite"></span>
    <button class="clearall" id="clearAll" type="button" hidden>Clear all</button>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
  .sr-only {
    position: absolute;
    width: 1px;
    height: 1px;
    padding: 0;
    margin: -1px;
    overflow: hidden;
    clip: rect(0, 0, 0, 0);
    white-space: nowrap;
    border: 0;
  }
</style>
